ER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"154\" height=\"55\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;30시간이상 활동의무</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"108\" height=\"57\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;생활지원</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"346\" height=\"57\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;유학생들이 본교생활에 잘 적응하도록 생활 중</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;어려운 점을 지원</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"154\" height=\"57\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1:1 또는 그룹내 </p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;교류메이트 지정</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"108\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;대외활동 지원</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"346\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;현장 문화체험 및 유학생과의 프로그램 참여</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"154\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">3. 활동기간 :&nbsp;<font color=\"#0000ff\"> 2010년 3월 8일 ～ 2010년 8월 31일(2010학년도 1학기 및 방학기간 중)<br></font><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">4. 모집분야 : <font color=\"#0000ff\">중국어, 영어, 일본어, 베트남어 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"><br></span><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">5. 모집대상 : </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 어학에 관심 있고 유학생들과 언어교류를 하고자 하는 자.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; - 본교에서 1학기이상 수학 한 재학생 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">6. 선발인원 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"></span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"114\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">교류지원 언어</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"92\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">중국어</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"74\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">영어</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"84\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">일본어</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"96\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">베트남어</font></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">선발인원</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"92\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">00명</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">2명</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"84\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">1명</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"96\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">1명</font></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">7. 선발방법 : 서류 심사 및 소정의 인터뷰 통과자.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">8. 지원자 제출서류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국제교류도우미 활동 신청서 1부. (Download)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 공인어학성적 사본 1부(지원언어가 영어, 일본어일 경우에만 해당)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">9. 수료 기준&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;- 국제교류도우미 단체활동에 적극적으로 참여했다고 인정되는 학생.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 활동기간내 교류메이트와의 스터디시간이 30시간 이상의 학습보고서를 제출한 학생.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;* 위 내용에 모두 부합되는 학생에게 국제교류센터장 명의의 수료증을 발급함.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">10. 봉사활동 확인서 발급 기준.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; - 수료기준을 통과한 학생에 한해서 활동기간이 끝난 후 봉사활동 확인서를 수여한다.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;11. 혜택<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 가. 수료 후 국제교류센터에서 파견하는 모든 어학연수 및 기타 선발파견 시 가산 점&nbsp; 부여.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 활동우수자의 경우 센터장 추천으로 해외어학연수 파견.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 다. 다음 학기 수강신청 시 봉사학점을 신청할 경우, 추후 봉사활동 확인서를 제출하면 봉사학점으로 인정됨.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">12. 선발일정<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">접수기간 : 2010년 2월 25일(목) ～ 3월 3일(수)</font>&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 나. 접수방법 : E-mail 접수 </span><a href=\"mailto:hjkim@kumoh.ac.kr\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">hjkim@kumoh.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"> (김혜진)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 다. 단체<font color=\"#ff0000\"> </font></span><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">인터뷰</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">2010년 3월 5일(금) 10:00, 14:00</span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 라. 인터뷰장소 : 대외협력관 강의실 212호<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 마. 합격자 발표 : 2010년 3월 5일(금) 17시 홈페이지에 게재&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 바. <font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>합격자 소집 및 오리엔테이션 : 2010년 3월 8일(월) 오후3시 대외협력관 211호</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">국 제 교 류 센 터</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
